---
/**
 * Overrides Starlight's Banner so the notice appears on every page, not only on pages
 * that set `banner` in frontmatter. sandboxr is documented ahead of its own code, and a
 * reader who lands mid-site from a search result needs to know that before they copy a
 * command.
 */
---

<div class="sl-banner">
  sandboxr is early: these docs are written from the contract, ahead of the code.
  <a href="/reference/status/">See what is built</a>.
</div>

<style>
  .sl-banner {
    --sl-banner-text: var(--sl-color-banner-text, var(--sl-color-white));
    padding: var(--sl-nav-pad-y) var(--sl-nav-pad-x);
    background-color: var(--sl-color-bg-accent);
    color: var(--sl-banner-text);
    line-height: var(--sl-line-height-headings);
    text-align: center;
    text-wrap: balance;
    box-shadow: var(--sl-shadow-sm);
  }

  .sl-banner a {
    color: var(--sl-banner-text);
  }
</style>
